WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:07.910
Every Wednesday, this funnel report ends in one decision, and a prediction of what that decision will change.

2
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:20.510
It opens with the one move with the greatest impact. This week, thirty one of sixty six new accounts pressed play on the welcome video. The move predicts eighty in a hundred.

3
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:28.240
The same move leads the Wednesday email, so nobody has to open the report to know what happens next.

4
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:40.460
Under the move sit the ten numbers that matter most, ranked by how far each is from its target. Take the tour, and the report walks you through all ten.

5
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:52.220
Each stop scrolls to the chart behind the number. Direct visitors sign up at thirty eight point five percent. Instagram, at twenty one point six.

6
00:00:53.300 --> 00:01:04.980
Stop two is this week's move: forty seven percent pressed play. Stop three is why every fix is judged on a phone first. Nearly ninety four percent of visitors are on one.

7
00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:15.570
The rest of the tour finds the leaks: more than half of visitors leave before a quarter of the page, and the median visit lasts twenty nine seconds.

8
00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:28.170
Every move ships with a prediction, and the hypothesis board grades each one against the new week. The Access your account button predicted seventy percent.

9
00:01:29.300 --> 00:01:37.360
It reached eighty point five. Sixty six of eighty two new accounts went in, against none of five before the button.

10
00:01:39.300 --> 00:01:49.130
Each edition re-scores every move from scratch. The star changed once, on the twelfth of November, and moved back as more people reached the video.

11
00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:56.890
Every step is held against its own target, so the next prediction starts where the gap is widest.

12
00:02:00.300 --> 00:02:05.570
It also says what it cannot see yet, and names the build that would close each gap.

13
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:19.640
The last move predicted seventy percent and reached eighty point five. This week's move predicts eighty, and the report grades it on the twenty fifth of November.

14
00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:25.640
One move a week, each with a prediction, graded the following Wednesday.
